      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2070024091889774657",
        "text": "Can Gemini actually design a good iOS app?\n\nI used to design a lot of iOS apps in Figma, but this past year I’ve been mostly using AI for web design and landing pages.\n\nSo I tested Gemini for iOS app design.\n\nThe biggest lesson: AI needs clear rules.\n\nOnce I added iOS requirements like Human Interface Guidelines, safe areas, Dynamic Island, SF Pro typography, 8pt grid, and realistic iOS components, the result got so much better.\n\nYou need to guide it like a designer.",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "Oluwaphilemon1",
          "name": "FHILY👑"
        }
      }
